{"id":"c94c3cae0b898de5","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-euler-product.md","title":"Euler Product","display":"df-euler-product — Euler Product","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-euler-product","aliases":["58-df-euler-product"],"display":"df-euler-product — Euler Product","depends_on":["[[../batch19/58-df-prime-number.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-dirichlet-series.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-euler-product"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-euler-product</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-euler-product — Euler Product"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dad686059f3ca152\" href=\"?note=dad686059f3ca152\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-prime-number.md\">../batch19/58-df-prime-number.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5d60e86f21ed502a\" href=\"?note=5d60e86f21ed502a\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-dirichlet-series.md\">../batch19/58-df-dirichlet-series.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathbb R\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathbb R\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F:\\{s\\in\\mathbb C\\mid\\operatorname{Re}(s)&gt;\\sigma\\}\\to\\mathbb C\">\\(F:\\{s\\in\\mathbb C\\mid\\operatorname{Re}(s)&gt;\\sigma\\}\\to\\mathbb C\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle a_n:n\\geq1\\rangle\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}}\">\\(\\langle a_n:n\\geq1\\rangle\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}}\\)</span> (Dirichlet-series parameters)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P\">\\(\\mathbb P\\)</span> (prime set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dad686059f3ca152\" href=\"?note=dad686059f3ca152\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-prime-number.md\">../batch19/58-df-prime-number.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_1=1\">\\(a_1=1\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_{mn}=a_ma_n\">\\(a_{mn}=a_ma_n\\)</span> whenever <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gcd(m,n)=1\">\\(\\gcd(m,n)=1\\)</span> (multiplicativity data)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EulerProduct}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{EulerProduct}_S\\)</span> (Euler product predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}euler\\text{-}product} \\vdash \\mathrm{EulerProduct}_S(F,\\langle a_n:n\\geq1\\rangle,\\sigma)\\leftrightarrow \\sigma\\in\\mathbb R\\land F:\\{s\\in\\mathbb C\\mid\\operatorname{Re}(s)&gt;\\sigma\\}\\to\\mathbb C\\land\\langle a_n:n\\geq1\\rangle\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}}\\land a_1=1\\land\\forall m,n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\bigl(\\gcd(m,n)=1\\to a_{mn}=a_ma_n\\bigr)\\land\\forall s\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\left(\\operatorname{Re}(s)&gt;\\sigma\\to \\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}|a_n|n^{-\\operatorname{Re}(s)}&lt;\\infty\\land F(s)=\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}a_nn^{-s}=\\prod_{p\\in\\mathbb P}\\left(\\sum_{k=0}^{\\infty}a_{p^k}p^{-ks}\\right)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}euler\\text{-}product} \\vdash \\mathrm{EulerProduct}_S(F,\\langle a_n:n\\geq1\\rangle,\\sigma)\\leftrightarrow \\sigma\\in\\mathbb R\\land F:\\{s\\in\\mathbb C\\mid\\operatorname{Re}(s)&gt;\\sigma\\}\\to\\mathbb C\\land\\langle a_n:n\\geq1\\rangle\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}}\\land a_1=1\\land\\forall m,n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\bigl(\\gcd(m,n)=1\\to a_{mn}=a_ma_n\\bigr)\\land\\forall s\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\left(\\operatorname{Re}(s)&gt;\\sigma\\to \\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}|a_n|n^{-\\operatorname{Re}(s)}&lt;\\infty\\land F(s)=\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}a_nn^{-s}=\\prod_{p\\in\\mathbb P}\\left(\\sum_{k=0}^{\\infty}a_{p^k}p^{-ks}\\right)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The identity is restricted to a common half-plane of absolute convergence and explicitly requires multiplicative coefficients.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch19/58-df-prime-number.md","status":"resolved","id":"dad686059f3ca152","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-prime-number.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-dirichlet-series.md","status":"resolved","id":"5d60e86f21ed502a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-dirichlet-series.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-prime-number.md","status":"resolved","id":"dad686059f3ca152","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbb P$ (prime set, see [[../batch19/58-df-prime-number.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\sigma\\in\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"F:\\{s\\in\\mathbb C\\mid\\operatorname{Re}(s)>\\sigma\\}\\to\\mathbb C","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle a_n:n\\geq1\\rangle\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathbb N_{>0}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb P","display":false},{"tex":"a_1=1","display":false},{"tex":"a_{mn}=a_ma_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\gcd(m,n)=1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EulerProduct}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}euler\\text{-}product} \\vdash \\mathrm{EulerProduct}_S(F,\\langle a_n:n\\geq1\\rangle,\\sigma)\\leftrightarrow \\sigma\\in\\mathbb R\\land F:\\{s\\in\\mathbb C\\mid\\operatorname{Re}(s)>\\sigma\\}\\to\\mathbb C\\land\\langle a_n:n\\geq1\\rangle\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathbb N_{>0}}\\land a_1=1\\land\\forall m,n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\;\\bigl(\\gcd(m,n)=1\\to a_{mn}=a_ma_n\\bigr)\\land\\forall s\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\left(\\operatorname{Re}(s)>\\sigma\\to \\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}|a_n|n^{-\\operatorname{Re}(s)}<\\infty\\land F(s)=\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}a_nn^{-s}=\\prod_{p\\in\\mathbb P}\\left(\\sum_{k=0}^{\\infty}a_{p^k}p^{-ks}\\right)\\right)","display":true}],"bytes":1459,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-498","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-euler-product.md|58-df-euler-product]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["dad686059f3ca152","5d60e86f21ed502a"]}